[[15,1,0,"<p>If necessary, turn\nthe rear brake drums to meet the tolerances indicated below.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nominal internal diameter (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Minimum internal diameter after skimming (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001286.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Measurement</p></th><th></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Minimum permitted internal diameter (mm)</p></td><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Once the minimum permited bore\nhas been reached, the rear brake drum must be replaced.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"]]